    "trigger": "You fail a skill check or saving throw.",
    "description": "Frequency once per day After failing a test of skill, you hop back in your personal timeline so you can try again. You reroll the triggering check with a +1 circumstance bonus as you apply your experience from your last attempt. You must use the new result, even if it’s worse than your first roll.",
